 "text": "Hey there, how are you feeling? It depends on the oil and the finish. Oils dry slowly, so it's usually weeks. I' wait at least a week, just to be sure. A quick sanding with a fine paper hamburger wrap. You could spray a thin layer of clear varnish, it dries in just a couple of hours. But it' only a stopgap. It should feel matte, not oily. Squeeze a drop on paper napkin, it should take a couple of days to soak in.",
